[{"data":1,"prerenderedAt":110},["ShallowReactive",2],{"news-detail-young-professionals-bootcamp-ypb-2026-n150-million-funding-opportunity-220":3},{"news":4,"more":27},{"id":5,"slug":6,"title":7,"content":8,"authorName":9,"authorId":10,"status":11,"recommended":12,"datePosted":13,"deadline":14,"images":15,"notifiedAt":14,"notifiedBy":14,"createdAt":13,"updatedAt":21,"categories":22,"readTime":24},220,"young-professionals-bootcamp-ypb-2026-n150-million-funding-opportunity-220","Young Professionals Bootcamp (ypb) 2026: N150 Million Funding Opportunity","\u003Cp>The Young Professionals Bootcamp is a leadership and enterprise program designed to equip young professionals with critical skills and mentorship to inspire innovation, and transform the economy.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Young Professionals Bootcamp Abstract\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Host: The Platform\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Location: Nigeria\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Category: \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Ffellowships\u002F?utm_source=Google&amp;utm_medium=Catergory&amp;utm_campaign=Email+Campaign\">Fellowships\u003C\u002Fa> || \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Ftrainings\u002F?utm_source=Google&amp;utm_medium=Catergory&amp;utm_campaign=Email+Campaign\">Trainings\u003C\u002Fa> || \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fgrants\u002F?utm_source=Google&amp;utm_medium=Catergory&amp;utm_campaign=Email+Campaign\">Grants\u003C\u002Fa>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Benefits: Full Sponsorship\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Professional Development\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Mentorship\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Networking\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Access to 150 Millionaire Grants\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Eligibility: Nigeria\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Deadline: May 24, 2026\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Young Professionals Bootcamp Details\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>The Young Professionals Bootcamp is a 3-day in-residence program designed to equip young people with world class practical training, inspire innovation, and accelerate solutions that will ultimately lead to the transformation of Nigeria.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>300 candidates will be selected from a pool of numerous applications to go through the intensive professional bootcamp.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>Candidates also stand a chance of accessing mentorship opportunities and seed funding to scale their entrepreneurial endeavors.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>The YPB has remained steadfast on its mission for a decade.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Young Professionals Bootcamp (YPB) Benefits\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>Young Professionals Bootcamp 2026 will :\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Free Training\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Successful candidates will be provided accommodation, feeding and training materials for the duration of the bootcamp\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Professional Skills: Fellows are exposed to critical skills, tools, and resources they require to thrive in their chosen career, via general training on leadership and curated sessions for entrepreneurs, corporate professionals, and creatives.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Mentorship: Fellows meet, engage and learn directly from the insightful stories and experiences of established industry mentors across business, corporate career and creative industry. \u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Community &amp; Networking: Fellows connect with one another and nurture rewarding relationships that will accelerate their career trajectory in the short and long term.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Grant Funding and Support: Fellows will get the opportunity to pitch their existing enterprises for a chance to win a seed grant from a fund pool of up to N150 Million, and receive support to scale their ventures.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>YPB 2026 Requirements\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>To be eligible for the Young Professionals Bootcamp (YPB), applicants must satisfy the following conditions:\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Be a Nigerian\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Be 20 – 35 years old by June 2026\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Be a Final year student or graduate from a tertiary institution\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Passionate about solving problems and thriving in Nigeria\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>How To Apply for Young Professionals Bootcamp 2026\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>To apply for the Young Professionals Bootcamp, follow the instructions we have outlined below; \u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Read the information we have provided on this webpage and ensure your eligibility\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Fill the application form in line with the application requirements.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Only the successful candidates will get to attend the bootcamp.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>APPLY HERE: \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fyoungprofessionalsng.org\u002F\">https:\u002F\u002Fyoungprofessionalsng.org\u002F\u003C\u002Fa>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003C\u002Fp>","linkskool",16,"published",0,"2026-05-08 18:15:29",null,[16],{"fileName":17,"oldFileName":17,"type":18,"file":19,"url":20},"assets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Fyoung-professionals-bootcamp-ypb-2026-n150-million-funding-opportunity\u002F69fe1a31a6bb11.06857374_screenshot 2026-05-08 175454.png","image","","https:\u002F\u002Flinkskool.com\u002Fassets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Fyoung-professi